SUMMARY:Wreath Workshop at West Wines in Healdsburg
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nThis Event is now Ful
 l! They have other events available on different days:\nhttps://www.eventb
 rite.com/e/wreath-workshop-at-west-wines-tickets-2003687680791?aff=oddtdtc
 reator&keep_tld=true#organizer-card\n\nThe Holidays are here in Wine Count
 ry and we are feeling Crafty!\n\nI have the pleasure of connecting with A 
 Little Extra Events and Rentals who are offering a workshop at West Wines 
 in Healdsburg.\n\n**Get ready for a hands-on\, creative workshop where you
 'll dive into the art of designing and creating a holiday wreath.**\n\nThe
 re is a maximum of 16 seats available at this time. Your spot is reserved 
 by prepaying for your ticket through EventBrite ticketing and website: [ht
 tps://www.eventbrite.com/e/2003687680791?aff=oddtdtcreator](https://www.ev
 entbrite.com/e/2003687680791?aff=oddtdtcreator "https://www.eventbrite.com
 /e/2003687680791?aff=oddtdtcreator")\n\nThe cost of the event is $56 per p
 erson. They provide the materials and guidance creating on wreaths\, plus 
 a complimentary glass of wine.\n\nGuests are welcome\, they will need to p
 re-pay as well. I suggest you wear layers as we might be outside\, and som
 etimes the weather is windy or cold. We will confirm headcount about a wee
 k before\, they will do refunds up to 1 week before.\n\nCheers to this fun
  crafty event!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /317082162/
