SUMMARY:SCWWC Holiday Party and Gift Exchange!
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nThe holidays are here
  in Sonoma County!\n\nWe are celebrating the holidays as a group and want 
 to invite You to join us for a fun low-key gathering.\n\nPlease bring a wr
 apped gift worth up to $16 and either a bottle of wine OR a dish to share.
 \n\nWe will have a non-alcoholic cider or something similar for everyone\,
  plus will do a gift exchange and fun mingling game.\n\nOne of our members
 \, Gail\, has generously offered to host our gathering at her lovely house
  in Petaluma\, and I will send out the address two days before\, on the 11
 th.\n\n25 spots available\, you may have one guest. Please RSVP only if yo
 u are able to make it\, and list in the comments on this post if you are b
 ringing a bottle of wine OR a dish/appetizer/main to share with the group.
 \n\nCheers\, I look forward to seeing you all there and celebrating the en
 d of 2026 with you!\n\nJoleen
